1
00:00:05,231 --> 00:00:07,471
(Bernadette:)Can I get your opinion on something
that happened at work today?

2
00:00:07,634 --> 00:00:08,804
(Penny:)-Yeah, sure.
-of course.

3
00:00:08,969 --> 00:00:12,469
(Bernadette:)I did something that will either
make me look like a lovable goof

4
00:00:12,639 --> 00:00:15,679
(Bernadette:)or a horrible monster damned
to spend eternity in hell.

5
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:18,650
(Amy:)I'm sure it's lovable.

6
00:00:18,812 --> 00:00:20,792
(Penny:)I'm gonna go with monster.
What do you got?

7
00:00:22,182 --> 00:00:24,252
(Bernadette:)Well, there's this lady
in our office who's retiring,

8
00:00:24,417 --> 00:00:26,827
(Bernadette:)and they were passing around one of
those big cards for us to sign...

9
00:00:26,987 --> 00:00:27,987
(Bernadette:)Okay.

10
00:00:28,154 --> 00:00:31,534
(Bernadette:)No one told me she was in a horrible
car accident over the weekend

11
00:00:31,691 --> 00:00:33,931
(Bernadette:)and what I was signing
was not a retirement card

12
00:00:34,094 --> 00:00:35,834
but was actually a "get well" card.

13
00:00:35,996 --> 00:00:38,536
(Penny:)I'm liking my odds here.

14
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:42,680
(Bernadette:)So on the card, in the hospital,

15
00:00:42,836 --> 00:00:45,546
(Bernadette:)next to the woman who's clinging
to life are the words,

16
00:00:45,705 --> 00:00:47,845
"Hey, Vivian. You deserve this.

17
00:00:52,012 --> 00:00:53,552
(Bernadette:)And at least with you gone,

18
00:00:53,713 --> 00:00:55,523
no one will steal my yogurt
out of the fridge."

19
00:00:55,682 --> 00:00:57,322
No!

20
00:00:59,619 --> 00:01:00,829
"LOL. Smiley face."

21
00:01:00,987 --> 00:01:03,027
(Amy:)Oh, my gosh.

